# Wi-Fi Password Rule File for Hashcat
# Optimized for WPA/WPA2 cracking (8-63 char passwords)
# Rules ordered by probability (most likely mutations first)
#
# Format: hashcat rule syntax
# See: https://hashcat.net/wiki/doku.php?id=rule_based_attack

